><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>In the absence of nutritional intake during exercise, an athlete’s&#xD;typical dietary intake explains, in part, the increases in i-FABP&#xD;induced by moderate sustained and high-intensity interval exercise&#xD;(&lt; 1 hr) in the heat.</span
></p
></body
